title: Campaign Between Elections
subtitle: Spend one resource to organise inside a national voter bloc.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
frequency: 200
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_campaigning_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_campaigning_timer = 2
card-image: img/poland/cards/campaigning.webp

= Campaign Between Elections

Every party is already contesting the same country. Choose where organisers,
mail, visits and local candidates should concentrate before the next poll.

- @metropolitan
- @professionals
- @public_services
- @industrial
- @provincial
- @rural
- @older
- @youth
- @skip

@metropolitan
title: Urban middle-class voters
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Strong equality reach, direct competition with KO.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; metropolitan_liberals_left_affinity += 4; women_support += 1; urban_progressive_support += 2; ko_relation -= 1; news_headline = "Lewica contests the urban middle-class electorate"

Canvassers work the same staircases KO's do, often on the same evenings. The
Left wins the equality argument in these buildings and has to keep proving it
is not simply the more strident version of the party next door.

- #poland_card_finish


@professionals
title: Professionals and academics
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Credibility and competence matter more than slogans.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; liberal_professionals_left_affinity += 4; public_trust += 2; media_capacity += 1; ko_relation -= 2; news_headline = "Policy teams campaign among professionals and academics"


Panels, expert appearances and a defensible costing get the party taken
seriously by people who read the footnotes. It buys credibility slowly and it
buys almost no doorstep enthusiasm at all.

- #poland_card_finish


@public_services
title: Public-service families
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Teachers, nurses and care workers become the field plan.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; public_service_families_left_affinity += 5; public_sector_support += 3; labor_credibility += 1; news_headline = "Public-service workplaces become a campaign network"


The schools, wards and care homes already contain the argument; they only
lacked an organiser. Staff who have been told for years that they are a cost
line meet a party that treats them as the constituency.

- #poland_card_finish


@industrial
title: Industrial and logistics workers
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Rebuild a constituency now dominated by PiS.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; industrial_logistics_left_affinity += 5; workers_support += 3; labor_credibility += 1; pis_relation -= 1; news_headline = "Organisers return to industrial and logistics workplaces"

Warehouse gates and plant entrances, at shift change, in the cold. This is
territory PiS holds on the strength of transfers rather than affection, and it
is retaken one workplace at a time or not at all.

- #poland_card_finish


@provincial
title: Provincial welfare voters
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Social guarantees need recognisable local messengers.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; provincial_welfare_left_affinity += 5; workers_support += 1; local_network += 2; household_policy_pressure += 1; last_policy_stage = "Advocacy"; last_policy_authority = "Election campaign"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "Lewica campaigns beyond the largest cities"


The offer travels; the messenger has to be local or nothing survives the first
contact. Organisers spend the month recruiting people who are already known in
the town rather than sending people who are known in Warsaw.

- #poland_card_finish


@rural
title: Rural localists
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. A difficult incursion into PSL and PiS terrain.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rural_localists_left_affinity += 5; rural_support += 3; local_network += 2; psl_relation -= 2; news_headline = "The red campaign reaches county and rural networks"


Village halls, fire stations and county fairs, where the Left has been an
abstraction since the 1990s. PSL treats it as trespass, which it is, and a few
hundred conversations happen that would otherwise never have started.

- #poland_card_finish


@older
title: Older welfare households
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Material security, health and a patient doorstep campaign.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; older_welfare_households_left_affinity += 5; pensioner_support += 3; health_policy_pressure += 1; last_policy_stage = "Advocacy"; last_policy_authority = "Election campaign"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "Lewica asks older voters to hear a social offer outside PiS"

This is doorstep work measured in cups of tea. Pensions, waiting lists and
whether the local surgery still has a doctor — asked patiently, by people
willing to come back a second time.

- #poland_card_finish


@youth
title: Young adults and students
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Compete with Konfederacja without imitating it.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 5; young_support += 3; turnout_readiness += 2; konf_poll_momentum -= 0.1; news_headline = "Young organisers campaign among young adults and students"


Campuses, rented flats and the parts of the internet Konfederacja has had to
itself. The pitch is material rather than merely cultural, because the
competition here is winning on rent and wages, not on manners.

- #poland_card_finish


@skip
title: Save the money
subtitle: The campaign remains national only on paper.
on-arrival: turnout_readiness -= 1; news_headline = "No voter bloc receives a sustained field campaign"

The resources stay in the account and the map stays as it was. No bloc hears a
sustained argument this month, and the organisers who wanted to be sent
somewhere spend it waiting.

- #poland_card_finish
